\newlabel{fig:airplane_pcycle}{{7}{21}{Basin portrait of the 3-cycle of the airplane map $f_c(z)=z^2+c$ ($c\approx -1.7549$, the real root of $c^3+2c^2+c+1=0$). The three colours correspond to the basins of $B_0$, $B_c$ and $B_{c^2+c}$; grey is the basin of $\infty $. The bounded components of the Fatou set form the characteristic ``airplane'' shape}{figure.7}{}}
